{"ID":180104,"post_author":"2711","post_date":"2025-08-28 11:55:33","post_date_gmt":"2025-08-28 10:55:33","post_content":"","post_title":"Retiro de tantra para mujeres","post_excerpt":"","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","post_password":"","post_name":"retiro-de-tantra-para-mujeres","to_ping":"","pinged":"","post_modified":"2025-08-28 12:22:34","post_modified_gmt":"2025-08-28 11:22:34","post_content_filtered":"","post_parent":0,"guid":"https:\/\/www.erescambio.com\/bloque_texto\/retiro-de-tantra-para-mujeres\/","menu_order":0,"post_type":"bloque_texto","post_mime_type":"","comment_count":"0","filter":"raw","author":"2711","id":180104,"individual":false,"acf":{"texto_a_mostrar":"libre","texto":"<p>Del 24 al 26 de octubre<\/p>\n<p>RETIRO DE TANTRA PARA MUJERES<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 28px;\"><strong>DESPIERTA TU FEMINIDAD Y FLORECE<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p>Enra\u00edzate en tu poder y \u00e1brete al gozo<\/p>\n<p>Imagina que floreces desde dentro. Que permites que tu energ\u00eda femenina se despliegue con libertad y confianza. Que tu cuerpo, tu emoci\u00f3n y tu alma vuelven a bailar juntos.<\/p>\n<p>A trav\u00e9s del tantra, el qigong, la respiraci\u00f3n y el trabajo corporal, liberar\u00e1s bloqueos, calmar\u00e1s tu mente y abrir\u00e1s tu cuerpo al gozo, la escucha y la presencia.<\/p>\n<p>Este retiro es para ti si:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>te relacionas m\u00e1s desde el miedo que desde el amor<\/li>\n<li>te cuesta soltar el control y disfrutar del placer<\/li>\n<li>est\u00e1s siempre en modo hacer y te olvidas de sentirte<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><b>SOBRE EL RETIRO<\/b><\/p>\n<p><b>Ubicaci\u00f3n:<\/b> Cal Codina (cerca de Igualada)<\/p>\n<p><b>Inicio: <\/b>Viernes 26\/10 a partir de las 19:00h<\/p>\n<p><b>Final:<\/b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0 <\/span>Domingo 28\/10 despu\u00e9s de comer<\/p>\n<p><b>Precio:<\/b> 390\u20ac<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> (<\/span>350\u20ac si lo pagas antes del 30\/09)<\/p>\n<p><b>Incluye:<\/b> Alojamiento y comidas<\/p>\n<p><b>Reserva:<\/b> 100\u20ac (Bizum) indicando en el asunto: NOMBRE COMPLETO y RETIRO TANTRA<\/p>\n<p>\nSOLO HAY 10 PLAZAS DISPONIBLES. RESERVA LA TUYA YA.<\/p>\n","boton":"Quiero saber m\u00e1s","url_boton":"https:\/\/api.whatsapp.com\/send?phone=34630127319&text=Hola%20Gemma%2C%20estoy%20en%20tu%20p%C3%A1gina%20web%20y%20me%20gustar%C3%ADa%20recibir%20m%C3%A1s%20informaci%C3%B3n%20sobre%20el%20retiro%20de%20tantra.%20","abrir_en_nueva_ventana":false,"imagen_a_mostrar":"libre","imagenes_laterales":{"imagen_izquierda":{"ID":180105,"id":180105,"title":"WEB RETIRO.001","filename":"WEB-RETIRO.001.jpeg","filesize":179063,"url":"https:\/\/cdn.erescambio.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/WEB-RETIRO.001.jpeg","link":"https:\/\/www.erescambio.com\/bloque_texto\/retiro-de-tantra-para-mujeres\/web-retiro-001\/","alt":"","author":"2711","description":"","caption":"","name":"web-retiro-001","status":"inherit","uploaded_to":180104,"date":"2025-08-28 11:00:27","modified":"2025-08-28 11:00:27","menu_order":0,"mime_type":"image\/jpeg","type":"image","subtype":"jpeg","icon":"https:\/\/www.erescambio.com\/wp-includes\/images\/media\/default.png","width":1080,"height":1350,"sizes":{"thumbnail":"https:\/\/cdn.erescambio.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/WEB-RETIRO.001-150x150.jpeg","thumbnail-width":150,"thumbnail-height":150,"medium":"https:\/\/cdn.erescambio.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/WEB-RETIRO.001-240x300.jpeg","medium-width":240,"medium-height":300,"medium_large":"https:\/\/cdn.erescambio.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/WEB-RETIRO.001-768x960.jpeg","medium_large-width":768,"medium_large-height":960,"large":"https:\/\/cdn.erescambio.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/WEB-RETIRO.001-819x1024.jpeg","large-width":800,"large-height":1000,"1536x1536":"https:\/\/cdn.erescambio.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/WEB-RETIRO.001.jpeg","1536x1536-width":1080,"1536x1536-height":1350,"2048x2048":"https:\/\/cdn.erescambio